WHAT WAS TESTED
Built packages/omo-codex/plugin/components/rules with `bun run build` (exit 0; dist/cli.js present), then ran the exact PostCompact raw-pipe payload shape from todo 3 for gpt-6-astra, unknown-model, and gpt-5.6-sol against a 760000-byte transcript in an isolated CODEX_HOME. The payloads had session_id, turn_id, transcript_path, cwd, hook_event_name=PostCompact, model, trigger=auto, and no permission_mode.

